      "content": "\"Letting go\" is just another way of saying \"stop trying so hard.\" You're stuck in this guilt cycle because you're trying to be someone you're not. The only way out is to accept that you're not that person. Stop pretending. Embrace your flaws and let them define you. There's no way out of guilt, only acceptance. You can't change the past, so why waste energy on it? Just be yourself, flawed and all, and find peace in that. It's not about finding a way out; it's about realizing there's no way out. Embrace it.",
